# 2026-07-03: M2 helper guard — nothing larger than source may ever become committable.
# /target/ also holds the CEF runtime files cef-dll-sys's build script copies next to the
# produced binaries; the CEF dist itself stays under the spike crate's gitignored cef-dist/
# (the reused M1 download — see Cargo.toml's CEF_PATH contract).
/target/
*.log
